": "Screenshot_8.png", "id": "1190956373101425", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491822550_1190956376434758_283753301311582343_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=JFTF1Qp4qDwQ7kNvwFRj6h-&_nc_oc=Adp7c2piqepYdX_bTofNm8xNFA2ozPQDoAYydgVajZZgcT4BhAWWFCLa5pSrdKPPKPc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7WWA_yknEdRHn6bL1FfPHg5MPZlKfuLq6CRN6KunLwpg&oe=6A07371F"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot_2.png", "id": "1148311920621628", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825257_1148311923954961_5667610839140367882_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=C5YATQpl680Q7kNvwFZlmHJ&_nc_oc=AdovsW2Sa8BJiWFKp1huZMfZz1eOXdQ05q-Qz5Dfkb66HdBmSwljXqSialHzMxC3opc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6QW5lCuEFQIAVisI_Kr9__YU5HMHPqGl8iw2Od0CgF9Q&oe=6A071540"}, {"file_name": "Scrnshot15.png", "id": "24251649731177731", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499303445_24251649734511064_2994127777093495213_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RfkoBd2lUvgQ7kNvwHzMNO6&_nc_oc=Adq2yDIv7SFm_j35xSBtq0Nj3BATxgYwp4-STPGa4gMi12bjpfQpgvELPpjmaWanlLs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7lattTddDs2988dgPzfr8aN44_10arL7bpWXJYRVVnsw&oe=6A073790"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot_9.png", "id": "1265078845396003", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491818885_1265078848729336_2803823632242628995_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=L0KpKlVbaxsQ7kNvwH1-Gr8&_nc_oc=AdqiY38lXCT_oZrRyQvy8RTMJK_umzkUufwcua6T-ZUyZGjbJ1-AcnfMMJn1v_qc08I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6xt0ELnsmgFoJrYVzKWrUEwgElHV1jTk_GGvE8t_IWrA&oe=6A073E73"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot_1.png", "id": "1932811260631650", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819239_1932811263964983_8227803877075376935_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dnH-E60mNfgQ7kNvwG9QQW3&_nc_oc=AdqlW1rTVpO3lo5lzeAUBC7brKT2Ha6RQfZ6e29a7g3RJYsCLVKXhI0nmllOqS8Cthk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6Us6rTcKd44e57-nBOFnOVOxC2rZfcUVYNExuxBQtmAQ&oe=6A0723C4"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "2k_banner.png", "id": "654563050924539", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825462_654563054257872_440537785091841093_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Y_WWbIftsmcQ7kNvwE9iRsU&_nc_oc=AdofOoHClOULjV47-nNxFkFRM4bw2mQLQutlw2IEALLBwHp9Q--k3Q_-tmhG-9vNkiE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4ygAHHBFIY3jrKGdjN10yWmJS42JsHGHWkB-vjVinG7Q&oe=6A0724B0"}, "display_name": "Vaultline Rush", "keywords": ["parkour", "freerun", "physics", "scifi", "climb"], "long_description": "\n# SPEEDRUN TRIALS\nVaultline Rush is a high-speed sci-fi parkour experience built for players who crave momentum, precision, and full-body freedom. Jump, Climb and Vault your way across a series of dynamic Trials designed to push your speed and skill to the limit.\n{2075582086602925}\n\n# UNPRECEDENTED FREEDOM OF MOVEMENT\nCarefully designed challenges will push you to your limits. \n\n{1495778928377487}\n\n# PHYSICS YOU CAN TRUST\nPhysics-driven movement with high-fidelity Fullbody IK. Every jump, catch, and vault feels precise and realistic.\n{1728056701197389}\n\n# PREDICTIVE VAULT SYSTEM\nVAULTLINE RUSH introduces a breakthrough in physics climbing by utilizing complex systems that manage the legs of the player, resulting in effortless vaulting.\n{710984608731039}\n", "short_description": "Experience high-speed sci-fi parkour in Vaultline Rush. Run, jump, and vault through physics-based Trials using a full-body avatar that delivers unmatched immersion and fluid movement."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/vaultlinerush/vaultlinerush-website/refs/heads/main/VaultlineRush%20Privacy%20Policy.txt", "developer_terms